ki. Więcej informacji na ten temat w naszej Polityce prywatności »\nW. Cejrowski BOSO PRZEZ ŚWIAT - MEKSYK - DVD\nW. Cejrowski BOSO PRZEZ ŚWIAT - MEKSYK\nNośnik: DVD\nCzas trwania: 172 minut\nWojciech Cejrowski- trzeci w historii Polak przyjęty do Royal Geographical Society (Królewskie Towarzystwo Geograficzne) w Londynie. Od dwudziestu lat organizuje wyprawy w najdziksze zakątki kuli ziemskiej. W serii programów telewizyjnych;Boso przez świat; z fantazją i niezwykłym poczuciem humoru oprowadza po egzotycznych zakamarkach świata. Tym razem zaprasza do Afryki zachodniej; Senegalu, Gambii i na Wyspy Zielonego Przylądka.\nOdcinki: 1. Największe miasto świata / 2. Ale jazda! Ale Meksyk! / 3. Mexico- miasto z przeszłością / 4. Mariachi- uliczna balanga / 5. Hacjenda / 6. Pueblo / 7. Guadalupe - największy odpust świata\nAby powiększyć kliknij w zdjęcie\nMoże zainteresują Cię także i te produkty?","tokens":["U","ż","y","w","amy"," pl","ik","ów"," cookies",","," aby"," u","ł","at","wi","ć"," Pa","ń","st","wu"," kor","zy","stan","ie"," z"," nas","z","ego"," ser","w","isu","."," Je","ś","li"," nie"," bl","ok","uj","ą"," Pa","ń","st","wo"," ty","ch"," pl","ik","ów",","," oz","n","ac","za"," to",","," że"," z","g","ad","z","ają"," się"," na"," ich"," u","ż","y","cie"," o","raz"," z","ap","isan","ie"," w"," p","ami","ę","ci"," ur","zą","d","zen","ia","."," Pr","z","yp","omin","amy",","," że"," mo","ż","na"," sam","od","z","iel","nie"," z","ar","zą","d","za","ć"," pl","ik","ami"," cookies",","," z","m","ien","ia","j","ą","c"," ","ust","aw","ien","ia"," prz","eg","l","ą","dark","i","."," Wi","ę","ce","j"," inform","ac","ji"," na"," ten"," tem","at"," w"," nas","ze","j"," Pol","ity","ce"," p","ry","wat","no","ści"," »","\n","W","."," Ce","j","row","ski"," B","OS","O"," PR","ZE","Z"," �","�","W","I","AT"," -"," ME","KS","Y","K"," -"," DVD","\n","W","."," Ce","j","row","ski"," B","OS","O"," PR","ZE","Z"," �","�","W","I","AT"," -"," ME","KS","Y","K","\n","No","ś","nik",":"," DVD","\n